<title>USA: Echlin sees likely Q4 gain from unit sale.</title>
<headline>Echlin sees likely Q4 gain from unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Echlin Inc said it is likely to post a gain for the fourth quarter ending August 31, 1997 from the proposed sale of its Preferred Plastic Sheet Division, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The amount of the gain will not be disclosed until it reports its fourth quarter results in October, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>Earlier today, Echlin announced that it has agreed to sell its Preferred Plastic Sheet Division to Spartech Corp for an undisclosed sum.</p>
</text>
